  <label>Turn on merge records</label>
  <protected>true</protected>
  <values>
    <field>Data_Type__c</field>
    <value xsi:type="xsd:string">Checkbox</value>
  </values>
  <values>
    <field>Description__c</field>
    <value xsi:type="xsd:string">Turn this on to add Merge Records to the Duplicate Matching tab, where an admin merges two records of the same BarnCRM object (two funds, say): pick the one to keep, choose which value each field keeps, and the related records move to it. Every merge can be undone for 15 days. People and households keep their own merge. It is off until you turn it on.</value>
